{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415707","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415707","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041570701:0":{"text":"여기서 선조님을 뵙다니, 정말 기이한 인연이군요!","source_cn":"没想到会在这里见到先祖，真是奇妙的缘分啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166FEB8839655BDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570702:0":{"text":"제 기억이 맞다면... 성함이 아마 틸, 오... 그래요, 틸로아 현자님이시지요?","source_cn":"要是我没记错的话，你是缇……哦，想起来了，缇洛亚贤者，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8D40FE553A9F0A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570703:0":{"text":"잠깐만! 제가... 선조라고요?! 사, 사람 잘못 보신 거 아니에요?","source_cn":"等等！我……？先祖？！你、你认错人了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214D5326C7F2A55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570704:0":{"text":"아닙니다. 아직 노안이 올 나이는 아니니, 잘못 봤을 리가 없지요!","source_cn":"不不不，我还没到老眼昏花的年纪，不会认错人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x204AF365F934873B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570705:0":{"text":"역사의 두루마리에 그려진 모습보다 훨씬 젊어 보이시지만, 한눈에 알아볼 수 있답니다. 특히 이 아름다운 사슴뿔을 보니 더욱 확신이 들었지요!","source_cn":"虽然你看上去比记史卷轴绘制的模样年轻不少，但我一眼就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x774845992AB16F5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570706:0":{"text":"정말 예상치 못한 상황이네요...","source_cn":"哇哦……真是出乎意料的情况……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19BDF8E6BE8FE340","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570707:0":{"text":"아무튼... 어.. 칭찬 감사합니다. 할머니 뿔도 관리 정말 잘 하셨네요.","source_cn":"总之……呃，谢谢你的夸奖？你的鹿角保养得也很不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF048FB71EA0B6EF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570708:0":{"text":"허허, 전부 다미안 녀석 덕분이지요.","source_cn":"呵呵，这都是多亏了达米安那小子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x950AA7E3EFE34845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570709:0":{"text":"녀석이 사슴뿔 영양액을 연구했는데, 대부분은 효과가 크게 없어요.","source_cn":"他研制了好几种鹿角滋养液，大部分的功效都还算说得过去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD0F6115D62A9533","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570710:0":{"text":"하지만 하나는 묘한 향기를 뿜어서, 사슴뿔 새순에 꼬이는 벌레들을 쫓아낸다고 하던데...","source_cn":"我记得，其中有一种滋养液会散发奇特的香味，能够驱赶被鹿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x464C5DFCB6E3C923","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570711:0":{"text":"네? 벌레를 쫓아낸다고요?! 그거 어디서 구할 수 있나요?","source_cn":"听起来不错，分我点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25375FB1B9FEC503","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570712:0":{"text":"여기로 옮겨온 뒤로, 머리 주변에 나비랑 벌이 점점 더 많아져서요. 아무리 쫓아내도 끝이 없어요...","source_cn":"自从移居过来以后，围绕在我头上的蝴蝶和蜜蜂就越来越多，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6489B02241CFC098","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570713:0":{"text":"검술 연습할 때조차 계속 날아다녀서, 검을 휘두르기도 어렵다니까요!","source_cn":"就连我练习刀法的时候它们都在我身边飞来飞去。害得我挥刀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x785FA59CF85A0726","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570714:0":{"text":"흠... 확실히 성가시겠군요. 하지만 아직은 사용하기 힘들 겁니다...","source_cn":"唉，恐怕很困难。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BAC8874A3EB7917","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570715:0":{"text":"그 영양액에 부작용이 있거든요. 바로 뿔에서 새순이 끊임없이 돋아나는 겁니다. 하루에도 몇 번은 정리해야 하지요...","source_cn":"这种滋养液的副作用有点严重，会让双角源源不断地萌发新芽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE78AE364AA20123C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570716:0":{"text":"전날 밤에 쓰면, 다음 날 아침에 일어날 때쯤엔 뿔에서 난 잎이 눈앞을 가릴 만큼 자라 있어요!","source_cn":"前一天晚上睡觉前用，第二天睡醒的时候，角上的树叶都长到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BF9A33FBE758411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570717:0":{"text":"다미안 그 녀석은 발명품 부작용은 신경도 안 써서, 항상 고생이랍니다!","source_cn":"哼，达米安那臭小子，每次搞发明都不注意有什么副作用，可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA7095C11F2CF6F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570718:0":{"text":"그렇게 심각한가요...","source_cn":"居然这么严重……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA0C35EA62814A3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041570719:0":{"text":"그래서 이 우산 지팡이로 아주 따끔하게 혼을 내줬지요!","source_cn":"为了这事，我可是拿伞杖好好教训了他一顿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B0FE7C31EC11087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041570720:0":{"text":"따끔하게 혼을 내요?! 어린애한테 너무한 거 아닌가요?","source_cn":"教训那么小的孩子？这不太好吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90CA045B2E7DE803","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041570721:0":{"text":"그래야 정신을 차리죠! 틸로아 현자님도 이렇게 동생분을 가르치지 않으셨나요?","source_cn":"就该这样！缇洛亚贤者，你不也是这样教训你弟弟的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59501B86FF30D5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041570722:0":{"text":"제가요? 그걸 어떻게... 아니, 전혀요!","source_cn":"我？我没有啊……我有吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0609D96C43217C5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041570723:0":{"text":"역사의 두루마리에 그렇게 적혀 있더군요. 그래서 저는 항상 현자님의 모습을 닮았다고 칭찬을 받았답니다, 하하하!","source_cn":"记史卷轴上是这么记载的。就是因为这样，我一直被别人称赞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1B6A24F354F03E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041570724:0":{"text":"세상에... 나, 후대에 대체 어떤 꼴로 전해진 거야?!","source_cn":"天哪……我究竟给后世留下了什么形象啊！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64EA854A6E7A1DA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:达赫妮":{"text":"다프니","source":"达赫妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:缇洛亚":{"text":"틸로아","source":"缇洛亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":2}}